(ned CAL PIVOT - one touch of the two-touch pivot-length measurement)
(operator 2026-08-05: "measure tip, turn some known angle, measure again.)
(user moves the tip over the probe and that is it." Press 1: any pose,)
(usually upright. Operator then tilts A by MPG to the biggest angle where)
(the tip still clearly touches first, re-parks over the puck, press 2.)
(The probe capture records the REAL A at trigger - no preset angles. The)
(GUI computes L = dZ / [cosA1 - cosA2] and writes head_pivot.inc.)
o<cal_pivot_touch> sub
#<fast_fr> = #3004
#<slow_fr> = #3005
o1 if [[#<fast_fr> LE 0] OR [#<slow_fr> LE 0]]
    (abort, cal_pivot: probe feed rates #3004/#3005 are zero)
o1 endif
M64 P3
G4 P0.4
G91
G38.2 Z-30 F#<fast_fr>
G38.5 Z5  F#<fast_fr>
G38.2 Z-4 F#<slow_fr>
#<zt> = #5063
#<at> = #5064
G38.5 Z8 F#<fast_fr>
G90
M65 P3
(DEBUG, EVAL[vcp.getWidget{"ned_controls"}.cal_pivot_point{#<zt>, #<at>}])
o<cal_pivot_touch> endsub
M2
